###

### Get all subraces for Araka
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifirace/subrace/race/{{arakaRaceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get all subraces for a race that doesn't exist - expect 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifirace/subrace/race/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@arakaSubraceId = 1

### Get subrace by id (House Gears, assuming it's the first subrace created = id 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifirace/subrace/{{arakaSubraceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get subrace by id - not found case
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifirace/subrace/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update subrace (House Gears -> rename/description tweak)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifirace/subrace/{{arakaSubraceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subRaceName": "House Gears",
    "description": "Engineers and shipwrights of the Araka; keep the fleets running.",
    "raceStatsId": 0,
    "raceStats": {
        "modifiers": [
            { "stat": 4, "modifier": 1, "isLocked": false }
        ],
        "freeStatPicks": []
    }
}

###

### Update subrace - not found case
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifirace/subrace/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subRaceName": "Ghost House",
    "description": "Should 404.",
    "raceStatsId": 0,
    "raceStats": null
}

###

### Delete subrace (House Judgement) - also clears the field on any character referencing it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifirace/subrace/11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Delete subrace - not found case
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifirace/subrace/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
